---
%% Closed-loop agent release pipeline: evaluate -> optimize -> gate -> canary -> promote
%% Combined source. Rendered as sequence.png (full) and sequence-1-evaluate-optimize.png / sequence-2-release.png (split).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User / App
    participant EP as Agent Endpoint<br/>(version_selector)
    participant AG as Hosted Agent vN<br/>refund-release-loop
    participant AI as App Insights
    participant TE as Trace-eval Schedule<br/>(monitor.py)
    participant FE as Foundry Evals<br/>+ Datasets
    participant OP as Agent Optimizer<br/>(optimize.py)
    actor ENG as Engineer
    participant GH as GitHub PR + Actions<br/>release-gate.yml
    participant ID as Entra ID<br/>(OIDC)
    participant PR as promote.yml<br/>(production env)

    rect rgb(232, 244, 253)
        Note over U,AI: 1 - Production: endpoint pinned to v1 (routing.py pin 1)
        U->>EP: POST /endpoint/protocols/openai/responses
        EP->>AG: route 100% FixedRatio -> v1
        Note right of AG: tool calls: lookup_order,<br/>get_refund_status, submit_refund
        AG-->>U: response (agent_reference.version)
        AG-)AI: OTel spans "invoke_agent refund-release-loop:1"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over AI,FE: 2 - Online eval: timerTrigger rule (cron 0 * * * *)
        TE->>AI: traceEvaluation: lookback_hours=1, max_traces=50
        AI-->>TE: last 1h of traces
        TE->>FE: evals.runs.create<br/>task_adherence, tool_call_accuracy, intent_resolution
        Note right of TE: Preview: scheduled runs end "failed" with 0 traces collected<br/>(tool_call_accuracy unsupported for hosted agents)
    end

    rect rgb(237, 247, 237)
        Note over AI,FE: 3 - Dataset mining: register_datasets.py --from-traces
        FE->>AI: trace data-generation job (agent_version=1, max_samples=30)
        AI-->>FE: dataset refund-release-loop-traces (30 samples)
        Note right of FE: + curated splits uploaded:<br/>-train / -validation / -release
    end

    rect rgb(243, 237, 250)
        Note over FE,ENG: 4 - Offline eval: azd ai eval run start --eval refund-train-eval
        ENG->>FE: run baseline on refund-release-loop-train
        FE-->>ENG: baseline v1 = 4/6 passed
    end

    rect rgb(253, 236, 242)
        Note over FE,ENG: 5 - Optimizer: optimize.py submit --base-version 1
        ENG->>OP: begin_create_optimization_job<br/>(baseline_agent_configuration + agent_optimization_space)
        loop each candidate (max 2)
            Note right of OP: mutate instructions / tools / skills
            OP->>FE: evaluate on train + validation<br/>(task_adherence, task_completion)
            FE-->>OP: score
        end
        OP-->>ENG: baseline 0.829 | candidate_1 0.9125 | candidate_2 0.867<br/>(draft versions, nothing routed)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 230)
        Note over OP,GH: 6 - Engineer applies the winner
        ENG->>OP: get_optimization_candidate(candidate_1)
        Note over ENG: branch optimize/candidate-1:<br/>write .agent_configs/baseline/instructions.md
        ENG->>GH: gh pr create
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 250)
        Note over EP,GH: 7 - Release gate (release-gate.yml on pull_request)
        GH->>ID: OIDC token (azure/login)
        ID-->>GH: Azure access token
        GH->>EP: release_gate.py prepare -> pin prod v1
        GH->>AG: azd deploy refund-release-loop<br/>-> v3 UNROUTED (endpoint stays on v1)
        GH->>AG: release_gate.py compare 1 -> suite.run(release split)<br/>via version_indicator sessions on v1 and v3
        AG-->>GH: refund_checks per case: repeated_submission,<br/>unverified_claim, claim_state_mismatch
        alt candidate regresses
            GH-->>ENG: FAIL v3 0.833 (unverified_claim) -> PR check red
            Note over ENG,GH: add branch protection to make a red check block merge
            ENG->>GH: push review fix
            GH->>AG: azd deploy -> v4 (unrouted) + compare 1
        else candidate >= prod and >= GATE_MIN_PASS_RATE
            AG-->>GH: v4 pass rate 1.0 vs prod 0.833
            GH-->>ENG: PASS -> merge
        end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 250)
        Note over EP,PR: 8 - Canary: promote.yml action=canary, prod_version=1, candidate_version=4
        ENG->>PR: workflow_dispatch (production env, add required reviewers to make it an approval)
        PR->>ID: OIDC token
        ID-->>PR: Azure access token
        loop stage in 5%, 25%, 50% of sessions (canary.py)
            PR->>AG: share of sessions pinned to v4 via version_indicator
            PR->>EP: remaining sessions via endpoint (v1)
            AG-->>PR: compare pass rate (refund_checks)
            alt candidate >= prod and 0 errors
                Note over PR: HOLD -> next stage
            else regression
                PR-->>ENG: ABORT (endpoint still pinned to v1)
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(232, 247, 238)
        Note over EP,PR: 9 - Promote: promote.yml action=promote candidate_version=4
        ENG->>PR: workflow_dispatch action=promote
        PR->>EP: canary.py promote 4<br/>wait_active + pin version_selector -> v4 100%
        EP-->>PR: routing.py show -> routed_version 4
        opt rollback (any time)
            Note over EP,PR: action=rollback prod_version=1 -> canary.py rollback 1 re-pins version_selector to v1
        end
    end
